From {{inh|en|enm|so}}, {{m|enm|swo}}, {{m|enm|zuo}}, {{m|enm|swa}}, {{m|enm|swe}}, from {{inh|en|ang|swā}}, {{m|ang|swǣ}}, {{m|ang|swē|t=so, as, the same, such, that}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*swā}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*swa}}, {{m|gem-pro|*swē|t=so}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*swé|*swē, *swō}} (reflexive pronomial stem). Cognate with {{cog|sco|sae|t=so}}, {{cog|stq|so|t=so}}, {{cog|fy|sa|t=so}}, {{cog|nl|zo|t=so}}, {{cog|nds-de|so|t=so}}, {{cog|de|so|t=so}}, {{cog|da|så|t=so}}, {{cog|nn|so|t=so}}, {{cog|sv|så|t=so, such that}}, {{cog|fo|so|t=so}}, {{cog|is|svo|t=so}}, {{cog|itc-ola|suad|t=so}}, {{cog|sq|sa|t=how much, so, as}}, {{cog|grc|ὡς|t=as}}, {{cog|ur|سو|tr=sō|t=hence}}.

